{"version":1,"content":"<p>他們曾被許諾將開啓一場畢生難忘的航行。642 英尺長的 「奧德賽號」 郵輪上，乘客最低花 10 萬美元即可購買艙位，開啓預期長達數年的環球之旅。如今，由於郵輪運營方突然終止航行，將問題歸咎於燃油價格暴漲，許多乘客被困在柬埔寨一座港口城鎮。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584204.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T16:20:49.590770+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T16:02:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T16:18:10.926337+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T16:18:10.926337+00:00","content_hash":"dbc8fd337c058c55b0153eeaf35ff3a71af975a2bf8804838a1c31e20cf34fe7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}